    {
      "text": "Timeline chart of a sample action line plan over years 0–10, with outputs grouped into identification and authentication (UHI and NASH services), information protection (NHIRF), national e-health information standards, computing infrastructure and core systems, and national broadband services. Bars show when each activity is implemented, operated or extended.",
